{"id":"659065","name":"上海青炒木耳","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/659065/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"上海青","amount":"3棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"泡发的木耳","amount":"10克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"上海青把叶子放食盐洗净。","img":"images/659065/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅里烧开水放入上海青焯一下水捞出备用。","img":"images/659065/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"在倒入泡发的木耳焯水捞出备用。","img":"images/659065/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"红辣椒洗净切成粗丝。","img":"images/659065/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"上海青叶子切粗丝。","img":"images/659065/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅里倒油烧热下葱丝辣椒丝炒香。","img":"images/659065/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入上海青翻炒。","img":"images/659065/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒均匀下入叶子。","img":"images/659065/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入木耳炒勻。","img":"images/659065/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒均匀放入松茸鲜。","img":"images/659065/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入盐调味品搅匀。","img":"images/659065/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/659065/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}